    "publishedAt": "2026-10-12",
    "summary": "Structera X 3406/3506 addresses these bottlenecks with: For DLRM workloads, Structera X delivers up to 2x higher queries per second and 2–3x more effective embedding-table capacity per controller. The Marvell CXL ecosystem continues to expand across the full data center stack through close partnership with CPU and memory vendors, OEMs, ODMs and system integrators. In the near future, these same managers will use CXL’s memory pools to reduce stranded memory and drive greater savings, and they will find controllers that offer compression, as this one does, to be even more interesting. As AI models and workloads continue to increase in scale, expanding memory capacity and bandwidth without compromising system performance and efficiency has become a critical requirement.",
