    "publishedAt": "2026-11-13",
    "summary": "13, 2026) — Vertiv Holdings Co. (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today introduced the Vertiv™ PowerStation 3100 RPP , a high-density remote power panel designed to help data center operators streamline power distribution for AI and high-performance computing (HPC) racks with power densities exceeding 100 kW. These architectures introduce new protection and power-isolation requirements. Delivered as a complete, UL-891 listed assembly, the solution is designed to support both fully AC power distribution and DC power rack architectures, enabling operators to standardize on a single platform across deployment types. The solution can be deployed as a standalone system or integrated with Vertiv™ SmartRun, Vertiv's integrated infrastructure solution that combines power and thermal management into a pre-configured system, or with Vertiv™ OneCore, a scalable, factory-built data center solution that brings together Vertiv power, thermal, and IT infrastructure.",
